00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:22.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we were best friends
ever since.

00:06:22.782 --> 00:06:25.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
I really, really,
I have a lot of love for him

00:06:25.451 --> 00:06:29.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this year, it was painfu
