00:06:29.922 --> 00:06:33.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
but everybody knows
he's an amazing man.

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:35.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's written
some fantastic greats.

00:06:35.862 --> 00:06:36.763 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-He really has.

00:06:36.763 --> 00:06:37.597 line:92%
And so many of them have bee

00:06:37.597 --> 00:06:41.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
wonderful film and televisio
