00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:41.801 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
as with yours.

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:44.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, thank you so much
for making the time for us

00:06:44.337 --> 00:06:44.871 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thank you!

00:06:44.871 --> 00:06:47.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know you have to do so much
